window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>If she fails, her whole team could be destroyed.</p> <p>Lexi \"Lynx\" Sabado is more than ready for her marriage with ex-SEAL Striker Rheas. But getting her happily ever after is fraught with hurdles when her psychic abilities start going haywire, giving her vague warnings of impending danger.</p> <p>As it turns out, identifying threats can be overwhelming when everything and everyone is the potential source. The guy at the CIA who mistook her for her mom, the undercover work she's doing with the FBI, her dear friend's upcoming wedding where the Assemblymen will gather . . . the peril could be coming from any direction.</p> <p>What's a psychic to do when danger is closing in on all sides and time is running out?</p> <p>Lexi must navigate this new labyrinth with her head on a swivel and her psychic warning system blaring.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
